<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92395" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥί̄γ-ιον</span></b> , 
			Comp.
		 neut. Adj. formed from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥιγέω</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>more
				horrible</i> or <i>miserable</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τό οἱ καὶ ῥ. ἔσται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					1.325
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				563
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				11.405
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ δὲ ῥ . . . ἄλγεα πάσχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					20.220
				</span></i>
			; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυναικὸς] κακῆς οὐ ῥ. ἄλλο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Op.</u>
					703
				</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">
				Semon.
				6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>colder</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτὶ ἕσπερα ῥ. ἔσται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					17.191
				</span></i>
			.—The masc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥιγίων</span>
			is not found.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Greek-English Lexicon</u>
        </u> (Henry George Liddell, Robert Scott, Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1940) </div>
